      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "An ideal solution would be to add support for MToon. MToon is designed for mobile devices with low specifications, like the Quest, and is maintained with the support of the VRM Consortium. It's also far, far more optimised than the above listed shaders, being made from the ground up in a simple and effective way. \n\nhttps://github.com/Santarh/MToon",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
