      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "if more then one person has the same shader they can be draw with one drawcall. multifunctional Shaders like Poiyomi cant do this because they need to turn off the features that aren't used. making them run like different shaders in terms of draw calls. so probably wont happen unless my understanding is flawed",
